  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Grant for by elections monitoring in Petauke</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Civil society through the Christian Churches Monitoring Group (CCMG) aim to systematically monitor the Petauke By-election as part of its Electoral Integrity Program. The findings from the monitoring will be used to advocate for the strengthening the management of electoral processes by improving transparency, inclusivity, credibility and accountability of electoral process. In addition, the proposed initiative is part of an ongoing preparations by CCMG to enhance its capacity to systematically monitor the August 2026 national elections</narrative>
  </description>
